{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/extras/Rainy_Warfare.png?t=1748984236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the undead apocalypse in <strong>Wasteland Warriors</strong>, a fast-paced, 4-player co-op zombie survival game! Battle relentless hordes with the help of <strong>automated combat drones</strong>, each specializing in attack, support, or loot collection. Strategically mix and match drones to create the perfect loadout, then push your survival skills to the limit as you dodge, sprint, and vault your way through intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between each battle, visit the\u00a0<strong>shop</strong> to upgrade your drones and boost your abilities. Luck, difficulty, and your current loadout all influence what\u2019s available, making every run a unique challenge. Endure the relentless onslaught, facing off against epic boss battles along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/extras/WW_Logo_Vertical.png?t=1748984236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to take on the apocalypse? Grab your friends and prepare for battle in <strong>Wasteland Warriors!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612940?t=1748984236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/ff7b58e7acb5d1b414fb7858b1b5e4d9ec79db98/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748984236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/c21e6a9c19ad9eed0f0766a7dd59e7aff6970ed5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748984236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/c21e6a9c19ad9eed0f0766a7dd59e7aff6970ed5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748984236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Wasteland Warriors contains stylized, low-poly depictions of combat, including the killing of enemies. Additionally, the game features visual references to drugs and alcohol within the warriors' bunker environment, such as bottles and paraphernalia placed on shelves and tables. However, there is no depiction of consumption or usage by characters."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/extras/Rainy_Warfare.png?t=1748984236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the undead apocalypse in <strong>Wasteland Warriors</strong>, a fast-paced, 4-player co-op zombie survival game! Battle relentless hordes with the help of <strong>automated combat drones</strong>, each specializing in attack, support, or loot collection. Strategically mix and match drones to create the perfect loadout, then push your survival skills to the limit as you dodge, sprint, and vault your way through intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between each battle, visit the\u00a0<strong>shop</strong> to upgrade your drones and boost your abilities. Luck, difficulty, and your current loadout all influence what\u2019s available, making every run a unique challenge. Endure the relentless onslaught, facing off against epic boss battles along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse